USAGE

Create `.env` at the root directory and populate:

```
GEMINI_APIKEY=[Your API Key Here]
```

Install `uv` if you haven't already done so.

Install dependencies by running:

```
uv sync
```

Activate virual environment:

```
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Run:

```
python3 main.py
```

Open your browser and go to `http://127.0.0.1:2333/ask?inst="[Your Instruction Here]"` to get a response from `gemini-2.5-flash`.


DEMO

Example instruction:

```
http://127.0.0.1:2333/ask?inst=%22tell%20me%20a%20joke%20about%20coffe!%22"
```

Response:

```
"Why did the coffee file a police report?\n\nBecause it got mugged!"
```
